  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5904.01 Levels of License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5904.01 Levels of License. A provider license shall be issued for the following levels:\n\n(a) Apprentice;\n\n(b) Emergency medical responder (EMR);\n\n(c) New Hampshire EMT-basic (NH EMT-B);\n\n(d) Emergency medical technician (EMT);\n\n(e) Advanced emergency medical technician (AEMT); or\n\n(f) Paramedic.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #14328, eff 7-23-25, EXPIRES: 7-23-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
